{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは。\n山梨県出身、20歳の鈴木佑捺（すずきゆうな）です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "9月24日に発売されました『 Ray 11月号 』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「私たちが乃木坂46に憧れるワケ」の企画に"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "川端晃菜ちゃんと二人で掲載させていただきました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/moblkwvoR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "加入前ファンだった頃のお話、乃木坂46に加入してからの活動のあれこれをお話させていただきました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46しかみてこなかった人生の中で、今こうしてこの企画に選んでいただけたことがとても嬉しかったんです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなと私、乃木坂46の先輩方に憧れたきっかけや、好きという気持ちを沢山聞いていただきました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "手にとって見ていただけたら嬉しいです。\nそして誰かが一歩踏み出す勇気にもなれたら嬉しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてメイクや衣装も、いつもと違った私にしてくださいました🪄︎︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとね衣装が水色×白だったんです！\n晃菜にも緑が入っていたり\nサイリウムカラーを選んでくださったのかなと\nふたりでうれしいね〜って、！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幸せでした(˶´ᵕ`˶)\nありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobUfwAX5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobgTa2Wt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふわふわな雰囲気でした〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "水色と白はわたしの味方。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またすぐ書きます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "佑捺"}], "source": "official"}